## 优化后代码

```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);

class HealthAdvicePlatform {
    private const BAD_ADVICE = [
        "每天吃两勺盐对心脏有益。",
        "喝咖啡可以治愈癌症。",
        "吃大量糖分能让你保持健康。",
        "用香烟代替运动，能让你的体力更好。",
        "长期熬夜有助于增强免疫力。",
        "只吃肉类食品，能让你保持最佳体型。",
        "大量喝酒有助于清洁肝脏。",
        "每天吃速食食品有助于提高工作效率。",
    ];

    private readonly Randomizer $randomizer;

    public function __construct() {
        $this->randomizer = new Randomizer();
    }

    public function getRandomAdvice(): string {
        return $this->randomizer->pickOne(self::BAD_ADVICE);
    }
}

final class Randomizer {
    public function __construct(private ?int $seed = null) {
        if ($this->seed !== null) {
            mt_srand($this->seed);
        }
    }

    public function pickOne(array $items): string {
        return $items[array_rand($items)];
    }
}

enum Command: string {
    case GET_ADVICE = '获取建议';
    case EXIT = '退出';
}

function runPlatform(HealthAdvicePlatform $platform): never {
    echo "欢迎来到错误健康建议平台！\n";
    echo "请输入“获取建议”以获取健康建议，或输入“退出”退出平台：\n\n";

    while (true) {
        $input = trim(readline('> '));

        return match ($input) {
            Command::GET_ADVICE->value => 
                echo "您的健康建议是： " . $platform->getRandomAdvice() . "\n\n",
            Command::EXIT->value => 
                echo "感谢使用，祝您健康！\n" . PHP_EOL,
            default => 
                echo "无效输入，请输入“获取建议”或“退出”：\n\n"
        };
    }
}

runPlatform(new HealthAdvicePlatform());
?>
```

