## 优化后的代码

```php
<?php
function uploadImage($image, $maxFileSize = 5 * 1024 * 1024, $allowedTypes = ['image/jpeg', 'image/png', 'image/gif', 'image/webp']) {
    // 1. 基础验证
    if (!isset($image['error']) || $image['error'] !== UPLOAD_ERR_OK) {
        throw new Exception('文件上传失败: ' . $image['error']);
    }

    // 2. 文件大小验证 (MB转字节)
    if ($image['size'] > $maxFileSize) {
        throw new Exception('文件大小超过限制 (' . ($maxFileSize/1024/1024) . 'MB)');
    }

    // 3. MIME类型验证
    $finfo = finfo_open(FILEINFO_MIME_TYPE);
    $mimeType = finfo_file($finfo, $image['tmp_name']);
    finfo_close($finfo);

    if (!in_array($mimeType, $allowedTypes)) {
        throw new Exception('不支持的文件类型: ' . $mimeType);
    }

    // 4. 生成安全文件名 (UUID + 扩展名)
    $extension = strtolower(pathinfo($image['name'], PATHINFO_EXTENSION));
    $safeFilename = uniqid() . '_' . bin2hex(random_bytes(8)) . '.' . $extension;

    // 5. 确保上传目录存在且可写
    $uploadDirectory = __DIR__ . '/uploads/';
    if (!is_dir($uploadDirectory)) {
        if (!mkdir($uploadDirectory, 0755, true)) {
            throw new Exception('无法创建上传目录');
        }
    }

    if (!is_writable($uploadDirectory)) {
        throw new Exception('上传目录不可写');
    }

    $imagePath = $uploadDirectory . $safeFilename;

    // 6. 执行移动文件
    if (!move_uploaded_file($image['tmp_name'], $imagePath)) {
        throw new Exception('文件移动失败');
    }

    // 7. 设置文件权限
    chmod($imagePath, 0644);

    return $imagePath;
}

// 使用示例
try {
    $uploadPath = uploadImage($_FILES['image']);
    echo "图片上传成功: " . $uploadPath;
} catch (Exception $e) {
    echo "上传失败: " . $e->getMessage();
}
?>
```

## 关键修改点

| 问题 | 原代码 | 优化后 |
|------|--------|--------|
