```
Device Living Room Light created.
Device 'Living Room Light' added successfully.
Device Smart Thermostat created.
Device 'Smart Thermostat' added successfully.
Controlling device 'Living Room Light' with command: turn on
Device 'light1' removed.
Device 'light1' not found.
Weak reference to device 'light1' has been garbage collected.
Weak reference to device 'thermostat' still exists.
Device 'Smart Thermostat' removed.
Device Smart Thermostat destroyed.
```

